msgstr "Neuen Besuch beginnen"

#: learning_with_francis/templates/_visit_controls.html:12
msgid ""
"End Visit before handing this browser to someone else. Closing and "
"reopening the browser may restore this visit. Start New Visit ends it and"
" asks for a name again, then creates a new identity with zero activity "
"and all four subjects Still Learning. Previous learning data is deleted "
"and cannot be recovered by entering the same name."
msgstr ""
"Beende den Besuch, bevor du diesen Browser an jemand anderen weitergibst."
" Beim Schließen und erneuten Öffnen kann der Browser diesen noch aktiven "
"Besuch wiederherstellen. „Neuen Besuch beginnen“ beendet ihn und fragt "
