msgstr "EINTRETEN"

#: learning_with_francis/templates/cover.html:28
msgid "Your space to learn, practise & grow."
msgstr "Dein Raum zum Lernen, Üben und Wachsen."

#: learning_with_francis/templates/cover.html:30
msgid "Discover the project"
msgstr "Mehr über das Projekt"

#: learning_with_francis/templates/cover.html:37
msgid "About Learning with Francis"
msgstr "Über Learning with Francis"

#: learning_with_francis/templates/cover.html:38
msgid ""
"Learning with Francis is an interactive learning platform designed to "
"make learning more organized, engaging, and meaningful."
msgstr ""
"Learning with Francis ist eine interaktive Lernplattform, die das Lernen "
